# Scars of Abyssea (abyssea 175), the partial: a level 99 Warrior in Port Jeuno with A Journey Begins completed and the
# quest accepted (GMs). Each pair of its three maw quests completed with the third missing (The Beast of Bastore
# missing, A Delectable Demon missing, A Fluttery Fiend missing): the completion section needs all three, so Joachim
# offers nothing each time.
lists PortJeuno/Joachim/onTrigger PortJeuno/onEventFinish/338
char zone=PortJeuno pos=-51.344,0,-9.978 job=WAR lvl=99
quest Abyssea.AJourneyBegins completed
quest Abyssea.ScarsOfAbyssea accepted
quest Abyssea.ADelectableDemon completed
quest Abyssea.AFlutteryFiend completed
login
trigger Joachim                         # The Beast of Bastore missing: nothing
finish-if-event
quest Abyssea.ADelectableDemon available
quest Abyssea.TheBeastOfBastore completed
trigger Joachim                         # A Delectable Demon missing: nothing
finish-if-event
quest Abyssea.AFlutteryFiend available
quest Abyssea.ADelectableDemon completed
trigger Joachim                         # A Fluttery Fiend missing: nothing
finish-if-event
